            "type": "text",
            "text": "<p>Ethan Hunt and the IMF team face their greatest challenge yet when a rogue AI known as The Entity threatens to destroy world order. The final battle has arrived.</p><h3>Why watch it</h3><p>Christopher McQuarrie's swan song for the franchise. Filmed across 80 locations over four years, with practical stunts that push the limits of what is possible on camera.</p><h3>Details</h3><p>2025 · Action / Thriller · 169 min · Rated PG-13</p><p><strong>Cast:</strong> Tom Cruise, Hayley Atwell, Ving Rhames, Simon Pegg</p>",
